id: CTB-SRC0033-r1
source: SRC-0033
section: §3.1
kind: requirement
scope: ARC
title: Rule R1: connected architecture
applied-in: STG-00.A-1
text: Rule R1, connected architecture: every domain declares what it provides and what it consumes, cross-domain interaction goes only through declared contracts, and an undeclared cross-domain dependency fails CI.
